@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava korisnice Ana (umerene akne, fototip II), odgovor sadrži JWT i ulogu USER
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@dermawise.rs", "password": "user123"}

### Prijava korisnice Milica (isti upitnik kao Ana, ali trudna)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "milica@dermawise.rs", "password": "user123"}

### Prijava dermatologa, uloga DERMATOLOGIST
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "dermatolog@dermawise.rs", "password": "derm123"}

### Prijava administratora, uloga ADMIN
# @name admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@dermawise.rs", "password": "admin123"}

### Registracija korisnika za scenarije 3-6 (pri ponovnom pokretanju vraća 400 jer nalog već postoji)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "demo@dermawise.rs", "password": "demo123", "fullName": "Demo Korisnik"}

### Pogrešna lozinka daje 400 sa porukom
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@dermawise.rs", "password": "pogresna"}

### Bez tokena zaštićeni deo vraća 401
GET {{host}}/api/analysis/latest

### Administrator nema pristup analizi korisnika, 403
GET {{host}}/api/analysis/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
